# Sprint 1 plan (4 Sep – 18 Sep)

Goal: every role has something that runs end to end, however small.

| Owner | Deliverable | Done when |
|---|---|---|
| Dan | kernel worker, process table, RR scheduler | two dummy processes alternate, visible in a debug `ps` |
| Carol | inode/dentry stores | `mkdir`, `ls`, `cat` work on a test page |
| Bob | desktop mock | dock + one draggable window at 60 fps |
| Alice | embedding pilot | Recall@5 and MRR for two models on 60 docs |
| Esha | CI | lint, typecheck, unit tests on every PR |

Out of scope for this sprint: login, networking, persistence across reloads.

Demo at the 18 Sep sync.
